draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123057","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123057","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123057.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123057.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"- Follow-up to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122849.\r\n\r\nThis reduces clutter in the inspector, especially when editing subresources, as this category is present on every Resource in the inspector.\r\n\r\nThis category generally has no editable properties anyway, as the Script property and metadata below it are actually handled separately.\r\n\r\n- This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15319.\r\n  - Compared to the proposal, I ended up hiding the category in the main inspector as well to further reduce clutter, and avoid confusion as to why the RefCounted category would be present in one but not the other.\r\n\r\n## Preview\r\n\r\n`master` | This PR\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"392\" height=\"418\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/42f4fd64-ab9a-48d9-8648-fd9e168b03f5\" /> | <img width=\"392\" height=\"383\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6fff9b16-2f69-442d-ae78-4afe59d67310\" />\r\n\r\n`master` | This PR\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"392\" height=\"412\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d9948b56-a6e5-4f44-9989-ee0271623294\" /> | <img width=\"392\" height=\"383\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/40d4c08b-36dc-482b-9cb3-473690f346a1\" />","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123057/reactions","total_count":13,"+1":13,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123057/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}